166	2025-09-26 18:54:28.780586-04	{"pk": 11, "body": "[{\\"type\\": \\"why_choose\\", \\"value\\": {\\"title\\": \\"La mission\\", \\"subtitle\\": \\"Depuis 1982\\", \\"text\\": \\"Depuis 1982, Alternative Naissance offre du soutien aux femmes et aux personnes\\\\r\\\\nenceintes, aux couples et aux familles durant la grossesse, l\\\\u2019accouchement et la p\\\\u00e9riode\\\\r\\\\npostnatale.\\\\r\\\\nLa mission de l\\\\u2019organisme vise l\\\\u2019humanisation de la grossesse, de la naissance et de la p\\\\u00e9riode postnatale.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nLa qualit\\\\u00e9 du soutien re\\\\u00e7u lors de ces p\\\\u00e9riodes a une incidence profonde et \\\\u00e0 long terme sur :\\\\r\\\\nL\\\\u2019autonomie et le pouvoir d\\\\u2019agir;\\\\r\\\\nLe sentiment de comp\\\\u00e9tence et l\\\\u2019estime de soi;\\\\r\\\\nLe sentiment de comp\\\\u00e9tence et l\\\\u2019estime de soi;\\\\r\\\\nL\\\\u2019int\\\\u00e9gration du deuil (s\\\\u2019il y a lieu);\\\\r\\\\nL\\\\u2019int\\\\u00e9gration du deuil (s\\\\u2019il y a lieu);\\", \\"image\\": 7, \\"layout\\": \\"text_left\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"073aef45-9cca-4d75-9da6-b16364fa425e\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"why_choose\\", \\"value\\": {\\"title\\": \\"Les valeurs\\", \\"subtitle\\": \\"\\", \\"text\\": \\"Compos\\\\u00e9e d\\\\u2019une belle diversit\\\\u00e9 culturelle et identitaire qu\\\\u2019elle \\\\u0153uvre \\\\u00e0 honorer et \\\\u00e0 respecter, l\\\\u2019\\\\u00e9quipe d\\\\u2019Alternative Naissance souhaite offrir un service individuel et personnalis\\\\u00e9, inclusif, empathique, accueillant, respectueux et solidaire. Elle priorise en tout temps l\\\\u2019\\\\u00e9coute, le respect du pouvoir d\\\\u2019agir, l\\\\u2019autonomie et la reconnaissance de l\\\\u2019expertise de chacun concernant son v\\\\u00e9cu ou ses besoins.\\", \\"image\\": 8, \\"layout\\": \\"text_right\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"e37acb24-600b-4276-a9a8-bd3d33e8177b\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"why_choose\\", \\"value\\": {\\"title\\": \\"Engagement\\", \\"subtitle\\": \\"\\", \\"text\\": \\"Notre mission s\\\\u2019incarne principalement \\\\u00e0 travers les services individualis\\\\u00e9s offerts par nos accompagnant.e.s et intervenant.e.s, que ce soit dans le cadre des rencontres pr\\\\u00e9natales ou postnatales, de la pr\\\\u00e9sence \\\\u00e0 l\\\\u2019accouchement, des rencontres en relevailles ou des divers ateliers offerts par l\\\\u2019organisme.\\\\r\\\\nL\\\\u2019organisme veille en tout temps \\\\u00e0 sensibiliser notre \\\\u00e9quipe ainsi que les intervenant.e.s des milieux communautaire et institutionnel aux enjeux li\\\\u00e9s \\\\u00e0 la p\\\\u00e9rinatalit\\\\u00e9, ainsi qu\\\\u2019aux enjeux particuliers li\\\\u00e9s aux identit\\\\u00e9s diverses et intersectionnelles des familles que nous accompagnons (diversit\\\\u00e9 de genre, diversit\\\\u00e9 culturelle, diversit\\\\u00e9 familiale, etc.).\\", \\"image\\": 7, \\"layout\\": \\"text_left\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"eb4e5b38-491e-41f4-ba1c-1c4bd9bc4348\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"testimonials\\", \\"value\\": {\\"section\\": 1}, \\"id\\": \\"3ee0ce71-306c-4629-8b44-5b82ea3265f7\\"}]", "live": true, "path": "000100020001", "slug": "mission", "depth": 3, "owner": 1, "title": "Mission", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/accueil-2/mission/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "Mission", "content_type": 29, "header_title": "Mission", "introduction": "", "live_revision": 164, "show_in_menus": false, "header_subtitle": "Mission, valeurs et engagement", "latest_revision": 165, "translation_key": "9d75e167-cb70-44ef-a65a-0e0e276617a1", "show_page_header": true, "header_background": 8, "last_published_at": "2025-09-26T22:53:01.826Z", "first_published_at": "2025-09-25T20:10:12.010Z", "search_description": "", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": true, "latest_revision_created_at": "2025-09-26T22:54:26.579Z"}	\N	11	1	29	1	Mission
239	2025-10-01 20:16:42.576819-04	{"pk": 16, "body": "[{\\"type\\": \\"paragraphs\\", \\"value\\": {\\"paragraphs\\": [{\\"type\\": \\"item\\", \\"value\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"serae\\\\\\"></p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"8icjm\\\\\\">Depuis son origine, Alternative Naissance offre un service d\\\\u2019accompagnement \\\\u00e0 la naissance complet, individuel et gratuit favorisant la confiance, l\\\\u2019estime de soi et le pouvoir d\\\\u2019agir ainsi qu\\\\u2019un accouchement satisfaisant, un lien d\\\\u2019attachement parent-enfant serein et un sentiment de comp\\\\u00e9tence parentale.</p>\\", \\"id\\": \\"ffbab150-f180-4877-9271-474ef272fec4\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"item\\", \\"value\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"18206\\\\\\"></p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"6gnj5\\\\\\">Le soutien commence d\\\\u00e8s la demande de service (minimum\\\\u00a0: 15e semaine de grossesse) et se poursuit sans interruption jusqu\\\\u2019\\\\u00e0 6 semaines suivant la naissance. Ce continuum est offert par la m\\\\u00eame personne (accompagnant.e \\\\u00e0 la naissance certifi\\\\u00e9e) qui \\\\u0153uvre avec empathie et comp\\\\u00e9tence dans un champ d\\\\u2019expertise compl\\\\u00e9mentaire \\\\u00e0 celui du personnel m\\\\u00e9dical.</p>\\", \\"id\\": \\"256ceaba-b4d8-4e53-a6d3-83030e6f78e2\\"}]}, \\"id\\": \\"b6242a29-6137-4328-ae75-3fe6937280d5\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"benefits\\", \\"value\\": {\\"image\\": 7, \\"title\\": \\"Un accompagnement \\\\u00e0 la naissance comprend :\\", \\"points\\": [{\\"type\\": \\"item\\", \\"value\\": {\\"text\\": \\"3 rencontres pr\\\\u00e9natales \\\\u00e0 domicile;\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"1d5499f4-afbf-499c-89e1-a7f50e14c672\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"item\\", \\"value\\": {\\"text\\": \\"Une p\\\\u00e9riode de garde 24/7 d\\\\u00e8s la 37e semaine de grossesse en vue de l\\\\u2019accouchement;\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"900f3a00-8d25-4dd1-8895-301e7eb5f248\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"item\\", \\"value\\": {\\"text\\": \\"La pr\\\\u00e9sence \\\\u00e0 l\\\\u2019accouchement;\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"a2e43015-6b44-4c72-a06f-33a277f11567\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"item\\", \\"value\\": {\\"text\\": \\"2 rencontres postnatales \\\\u00e0 domicile;\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"44266d4f-fe2d-4652-8fd4-10c56038cc88\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"item\\", \\"value\\": {\\"text\\": \\"Un soutien tout au long du suivi sous forme d\\\\u2019un soutien t\\\\u00e9l\\\\u00e9phonique, de la recherche de ressources personnalis\\\\u00e9es et de la tenue d\\\\u2019un dossier.\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"63e1a221-fde4-4293-8212-9495ac005413\\"}]}, \\"id\\": \\"0faccea4-5c50-4117-bd9b-081e341f766b\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"liste\\", \\"value\\": {\\"title\\": \\"monday\\", \\"points\\": [{\\"type\\": \\"item\\", \\"value\\": {\\"text\\": \\"bla bla\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"795f874e-e342-46d3-8145-5cd96de9ac20\\"}]}, \\"id\\": \\"aca791e1-5292-4eae-bd22-c374b5d6601d\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"cta\\", \\"value\\": {\\"title\\": \\"Cliquez ici pour faire une demande de service.\\", \\"phone_number\\": \\"+1514-777-6666\\", \\"phone_text\\": \\"Appelez nos accompagnatrices\\", \\"button_text\\": \\"Demande de service\\", \\"button_link\\": \\"\\", \\"image\\": 7}, \\"id\\": \\"96ba2a98-e22e-44bc-9766-afa44b33908e\\"}]", "live": true, "path": "000100020005", "slug": "naissance", "depth": 3, "owner": 1, "title": "Naissance", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/accueil-2/naissance/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "Naissance", "content_type": 29, "header_title": "Naissance", "introduction": "", "live_revision": 238, "show_in_menus": false, "header_subtitle": "Accompagnement à la naissance", "latest_revision": 238, "translation_key": "c383c2d7-97c5-44d0-8d5c-d3d5b31b75f2", "show_page_header": true, "header_background": 8, "last_published_at": "2025-10-01T22:18:42.763Z", "first_published_at": "2025-10-01T16:16:11.846Z", "search_description": "", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpubl