142	2025-09-26 11:33:53.920312-04	{"pk": 11, "body": "[{\\"type\\": \\"why_choose\\", \\"value\\": {\\"subtitle\\": \\"Depuis 1982\\", \\"title\\": \\"La mission\\", \\"text\\": \\"Depuis 1982, Alternative Naissance offre du soutien aux femmes et aux personnes\\\\r\\\\nenceintes, aux couples et aux familles durant la grossesse, l\\\\u2019accouchement et la p\\\\u00e9riode\\\\r\\\\npostnatale.\\\\r\\\\nLa mission de l\\\\u2019organisme vise l\\\\u2019humanisation de la grossesse, de la naissance et de la p\\\\u00e9riode postnatale.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nLa qualit\\\\u00e9 du soutien re\\\\u00e7u lors de ces p\\\\u00e9riodes a une incidence profonde et \\\\u00e0 long terme sur :\\\\r\\\\nL\\\\u2019autonomie et le pouvoir d\\\\u2019agir;\\\\r\\\\nLe sentiment de comp\\\\u00e9tence et l\\\\u2019estime de soi;\\\\r\\\\nLe sentiment de comp\\\\u00e9tence et l\\\\u2019estime de soi;\\\\r\\\\nL\\\\u2019int\\\\u00e9gration du deuil (s\\\\u2019il y a lieu);\\\\r\\\\nL\\\\u2019int\\\\u00e9gration du deuil (s\\\\u2019il y a lieu);\\", \\"right_image\\": 7}, \\"id\\": \\"073aef45-9cca-4d75-9da6-b16364fa425e\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"testimonials\\", \\"value\\": {\\"section\\": 1}, \\"id\\": \\"3ee0ce71-306c-4629-8b44-5b82ea3265f7\\"}]", "live": true, "path": "000100020001", "slug": "mission", "depth": 3, "owner": 1, "title": "Mission", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/accueil-2/mission/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "Mission", "content_type": 29, "header_title": "Mission", "introduction": "", "live_revision": 139, "show_in_menus": false, "header_subtitle": "Mission, valeurs et engagement", "latest_revision": 139, "translation_key": "9d75e167-cb70-44ef-a65a-0e0e276617a1", "show_page_header": true, "header_background": 8, "last_published_at": "2025-09-25T20:31:39.519Z", "first_published_at": "2025-09-25T20:10:12.010Z", "search_description": "", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": false, "latest_revision_created_at": "2025-09-25T20:31:39.492Z"}	\N	11	1	29	1	Mission
201	2025-10-01 11:04:48.16666-04	{"pk": 14, "body": "[{\\"type\\": \\"paragraphs\\", \\"value\\": {\\"paragraphs\\": [{\\"type\\": \\"item\\", \\"value\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"onpe8\\\\\\">Faire partie du conseil d\\\\u2019administration est une occasion unique de prendre part aux d\\\\u00e9cisions de l'organisme, de comprendre les d\\\\u00e9tails du fonctionnement \\\\u00e0 l'interne et de soutenir l'\\\\u00e9quipe sur le terrain alors qu'elle d\\\\u00e9ploie des services essentiels aux familles de notre communaut\\\\u00e9.</p>\\", \\"id\\": \\"1d8e0082-690a-4498-909f-966169323332\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"item\\", \\"value\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"s93iq\\\\\\"></p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"9oi8a\\\\\\">Si vous avez le go\\\\u00fbt de participer activement au rayonnement d\\\\u2019un organisme communautaire que vous tenez \\\\u00e0 c\\\\u0153ur, ou si vous voulez plus de renseignements, n\\\\u2019h\\\\u00e9sitez pas \\\\u00e0 <b>nous contacter</b> (lien vers \\\\u00ab\\\\u00a0Contact g\\\\u00e9n\\\\u00e9ral\\\\u00a0\\\\u00bb)! Il nous fera plaisir de discuter de tout \\\\u00e7a avec vous!</p>\\", \\"id\\": \\"6453a4b9-b8ff-4a88-834d-1d522503f717\\"}]}, \\"id\\": \\"8ae44765-fa2f-4da9-8fc3-7cb662a89b6d\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"benefits\\", \\"value\\": {\\"image\\": 7, \\"title\\": \\"Qu\\\\u2019est-ce que le conseil d\\\\u2019administration?\\", \\"points\\": [{\\"type\\": \\"item\\", \\"value\\": {\\"text\\": \\"Le conseil d\\\\u2019administration est un regroupement de 7 personnes qui veille au bon fonctionnement de l'organisme, \\\\u00e0 sa sant\\\\u00e9 financi\\\\u00e8re, \\\\u00e0 sa croissance et \\\\u00e0 son rayonnement en soutenant la superbe \\\\u00e9quipe du bureau ainsi que les accompagnant.e.s, animateur.trice.s et formateur.trice.s offrant des services aux familles.\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"7abb298e-3cbf-464e-87b9-9ec6656d7c19\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"item\\", \\"value\\": {\\"text\\": \\"Le conseil d\\\\u2019administration se rencontre environ 10 fois par ann\\\\u00e9e. Selon leurs disponibilit\\\\u00e9s et leur expertise, les membres peuvent aussi participer \\\\u00e0 des comit\\\\u00e9s afin de faire avancer certains projets qu\\\\u2019ils.elles tiennent \\\\u00e0 c\\\\u0153ur et qui font partie du plan d\\\\u2019action \\\\u00e9tabli lors de l\\\\u2019assembl\\\\u00e9e g\\\\u00e9n\\\\u00e9rale annuelle.\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"03414cae-2bb4-4f13-8d53-27b505d5ba0d\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"item\\", \\"value\\": {\\"text\\": \\"Les membres sont \\\\u00e9lu.e.s lors de l\\\\u2019assembl\\\\u00e9e g\\\\u00e9n\\\\u00e9rale annuelle pour un mandat de 2 ans (l\\\\u2019assembl\\\\u00e9e se tient habituellement en d\\\\u00e9but juin).\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"70d614f4-2ed3-4fa7-a509-f0fba14ed4d9\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"item\\", \\"value\\": {\\"text\\": \\"Le conseil d\\\\u2019administration est compos\\\\u00e9 de 3 membres militant.e.s (personnes qui travaillent \\\\u00e0 titre autonome pour l\\\\u2019organisme) et 4 membres individuel.le.s (personnes de la communaut\\\\u00e9 ayant b\\\\u00e9n\\\\u00e9fici\\\\u00e9 des services de l\\\\u2019organisme).\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"8220f7d6-9eb6-4560-a445-679231c64691\\"}]}, \\"id\\": \\"0010d1e9-509f-4123-be1d-a7c02d21a938\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"testimonials\\", \\"value\\": {\\"section\\": 1}, \\"id\\": \\"e5d343a5-1b12-4a3a-a0e0-2cb952caa27c\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"team\\", \\"value\\": {\\"members\\": [{\\"type\\": \\"item\\", \\"value\\": {\\"image\\": 1, \\"role\\": \\"president\\", \\"name\\": \\"Polo\\", \\"facebook\\": \\"https://facebook.com/alternativetest\\", \\"twitter\\": \\"https://twitter.com/alternativetest\\", \\"linkedin\\": \\"https://linkedIn.com/alternativetest\\", \\"instagram\\": \\"https://instagram.com/alternativetest\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"d5cff833-efc3-4ad7-b29e-b8d7d7f72802\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"item\\", \\"value\\": {\\"image\\": 7, \\"role\\": \\"Secretaire\\", \\"name\\": \\"Lise Martine\\", \\"facebook\\": \\"https://facebook.com/alternativetest\\", \\"twitter\\": \\"https://twitter.com/alternativetest\\", \\"linkedin\\": \\"https://linkedIn.com/alternativetest\\", \\"instagram\\": \\"https://instagram.com/alternativetest\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"db54fdb5-4b36-4dc4-b831-3a1b73933e24\\"}]}, \\"id\\": \\"659a19e3-808b-4542-bd3b-44bd07d9b8a7\\"}]", "live": true, "path": "000100020003", "slug": "conseil-administration", "depth": 3, "owner": 1, "title": "Conseil d'administration", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/accueil-2/conseil-administration/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "Conseil d'administration", "content_type": 29, "header_title": "Conseil d'administration", "introduction": "", "live_revision": 200, "show_in_menus": false, "header_subtitle": "Conseil d'administration", "latest_revision": 200, "translation_key": "21b3fa3b-b848-4714-906e-d10623e6d512", "show_page_header": true, "header_background": 5, "last_published_at": "2025-10-01T14:55:13.932Z", "first_published_at": "2025-09-27T01:16:03.648Z", "search_description": "", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": false, "latest_revision_created_at": "2025-10-01T14:55:13.892Z"}	\N	14	1	29	1	Conseil d'administration
