242	2025-10-01 20:30:24.683132-04	{"pk": 16, "body": "[{\\"type\\": \\"paragraphs\\", \\"value\\": {\\"paragraphs\\": [{\\"type\\": \\"item\\", \\"value\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"serae\\\\\\"></p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"8icjm\\\\\\">Depuis son origine, Alternative Naissance offre un service d\\\\u2019accompagnement \\\\u00e0 la naissance complet, individuel et gratuit favorisant la confiance, l\\\\u2019estime de soi et le pouvoir d\\\\u2019agir ainsi qu\\\\u2019un accouchement satisfaisant, un lien d\\\\u2019attachement parent-enfant serein et un sentiment de comp\\\\u00e9tence parentale.</p>\\", \\"id\\": \\"ffbab150-f180-4877-9271-474ef272fec4\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"item\\", \\"value\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"18206\\\\\\"></p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"6gnj5\\\\\\">Le soutien commence d\\\\u00e8s la demande de service (minimum\\\\u00a0: 15e semaine de grossesse) et se poursuit sans interruption jusqu\\\\u2019\\\\u00e0 6 semaines suivant la naissance. Ce continuum est offert par la m\\\\u00eame personne (accompagnant.e \\\\u00e0 la naissance certifi\\\\u00e9e) qui \\\\u0153uvre avec empathie et comp\\\\u00e9tence dans un champ d\\\\u2019expertise compl\\\\u00e9mentaire \\\\u00e0 celui du personnel m\\\\u00e9dical.</p>\\", \\"id\\": \\"256ceaba-b4d8-4e53-a6d3-83030e6f78e2\\"}]}, \\"id\\": \\"b6242a29-6137-4328-ae75-3fe6937280d5\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"benefits\\", \\"value\\": {\\"image\\": 7, \\"title\\": \\"Un accompagnement \\\\u00e0 la naissance comprend :\\", \\"points\\": [{\\"type\\": \\"item\\", \\"value\\": {\\"text\\": \\"3 rencontres pr\\\\u00e9natales \\\\u00e0 domicile;\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"1d5499f4-afbf-499c-89e1-a7f50e14c672\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"item\\", \\"value\\": {\\"text\\": \\"Une p\\\\u00e9riode de garde 24/7 d\\\\u00e8s la 37e semaine de grossesse en vue de l\\\\u2019accouchement;\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"900f3a00-8d25-4dd1-8895-301e7eb5f248\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"item\\", \\"value\\": {\\"text\\": \\"La pr\\\\u00e9sence \\\\u00e0 l\\\\u2019accouchement;\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"a2e43015-6b44-4c72-a06f-33a277f11567\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"item\\", \\"value\\": {\\"text\\": \\"2 rencontres postnatales \\\\u00e0 domicile;\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"44266d4f-fe2d-4652-8fd4-10c56038cc88\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"item\\", \\"value\\": {\\"text\\": \\"Un soutien tout au long du suivi sous forme d\\\\u2019un soutien t\\\\u00e9l\\\\u00e9phonique, de la recherche de ressources personnalis\\\\u00e9es et de la tenue d\\\\u2019un dossier.\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"63e1a221-fde4-4293-8212-9495ac005413\\"}]}, \\"id\\": \\"0faccea4-5c50-4117-bd9b-081e341f766b\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"liste\\", \\"value\\": {\\"title\\": \\"canada\\", \\"points\\": [{\\"type\\": \\"item\\", \\"value\\": {\\"text\\": \\"bla bla\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"a60de595-1cdb-400c-bf5c-93752de929db\\"}]}, \\"id\\": \\"76730ded-3343-406b-ab6d-05a0c1b271c4\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"cta\\", \\"value\\": {\\"title\\": \\"Cliquez ici pour faire une demande de service.\\", \\"phone_number\\": \\"+1514-777-6666\\", \\"phone_text\\": \\"Appelez nos accompagnatrices\\", \\"button_text\\": \\"Demande de service\\", \\"button_link\\": \\"\\", \\"image\\": 7}, \\"id\\": \\"96ba2a98-e22e-44bc-9766-afa44b33908e\\"}]", "live": true, "path": "000100020005", "slug": "naissance", "depth": 3, "owner": 1, "title": "Naissance", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/accueil-2/naissance/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "Naissance", "content_type": 29, "header_title": "Naissance", "introduction": "", "live_revision": 240, "show_in_menus": false, "header_subtitle": "Accompagnement à la naissance", "latest_revision": 241, "translation_key": "c383c2d7-97c5-44d0-8d5c-d3d5b31b75f2", "show_page_header": true, "header_background": 8, "last_published_at": "2025-10-02T00:16:45.476Z", "first_published_at": "2025-10-01T16:16:11.846Z", "search_description": "", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": true, "latest_revision_created_at": "2025-10-02T00:30:22.419Z"}	\N	16	1	29	1	Naissance
255	2025-10-02 15:42:26.98679-04	{"pk": 18, "body": "[{\\"type\\": \\"cta\\", \\"value\\": {\\"title\\": \\"Cliquez ici pour faire une demande de service.\\", \\"phone_number\\": \\"+1514-777-6666\\", \\"phone_text\\": \\"Appelez nos accompagnatrices\\", \\"button_text\\": \\"Demande de service\\", \\"button_link\\": \\"\\", \\"image\\": 7}, \\"id\\": \\"b5d3882a-923a-4f33-b52a-418f040f87a0\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"paragraphs\\", \\"value\\": {\\"paragraphs\\": [{\\"type\\": \\"item\\", \\"value\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"0hsi1\\\\\\">Le service d\\\\u2019accompagnement virtuel p\\\\u00e9rinatal est propos\\\\u00e9 gratuitement aux personnes qui recherchent une oreille attentive mais qui ne peuvent pas ou ne souhaitent pas b\\\\u00e9n\\\\u00e9ficier de la pr\\\\u00e9sence d\\\\u2019un.e accompagnant.e \\\\u00e0 domicile. Jumel\\\\u00e9es \\\\u00e0 un.e accompagnant.e disponible selon leur horaire, ces personnes ont la possibilit\\\\u00e9 d\\\\u2019exprimer leurs besoins, de nommer leurs d\\\\u00e9sirs, d\\\\u2019apaiser leur anxi\\\\u00e9t\\\\u00e9, d\\\\u2019\\\\u00e9laborer leurs \\\\u00ab\\\\u00a0souhaits de naissance\\\\u00a0\\\\u00bb, de s\\\\u2019outiller pour la gestion de la douleur durant l\\\\u2019accouchement, de poser leurs questions, de recevoir des informations objectives, de soutenir la coparentalit\\\\u00e9 ou d\\\\u2019am\\\\u00e9liorer leurs conditions d\\\\u2019allaitement.</p>\\", \\"id\\": \\"a31bbf49-9431-4eb7-8ccf-0c4c3bea3412\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"item\\", \\"value\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"gdn8q\\\\\\">Ces rencontres virtuelles sont offertes par l\\\\u2019\\\\u00e9quipe d\\\\u2019accompagnant.e \\\\u00e0 la naissance et aux relevailles, dans le respect de la philosophie et du cadre de pratique de leur profession.</p>\\", \\"id\\": \\"4a36840a-29e8-40a1-ad20-b3ba30fcd94b\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"item\\", \\"value\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"gdn8q\\\\\\">Chaque personne ou couple b\\\\u00e9n\\\\u00e9ficie de 8 heures de rencontres, distribu\\\\u00e9es selon les plage-horaires qui conviennent \\\\u00e0 tous.tes, au cours de la p\\\\u00e9riode pr\\\\u00e9natale et\\\\u2044ou postnatale.</p>\\", \\"id\\": \\"727a1e59-7c53-46e6-b632-1a581f049a2a\\"}]}, \\"id\\": \\"60c04b9a-914d-4477-b2d2-b6844047cf3c\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"cta\\", \\"value\\": {\\"title\\": \\"Cliquez ici pour faire une demande de service.\\", \\"phone_number\\": \\"+1514-777-6666\\", \\"phone_text\\": \\"Appelez nos accompagnatrices\\", \\"button_text\\": \\"Demande de service\\", \\"button_link\\": \\"\\", \\"image\\": 7}, \\"id\\": \\"3aef199a-be91-4298-85d0-15d6199b5dfc\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"testimonials\\", \\"value\\": {\\"section\\": 1}, \\"id\\": \\"2e0d67a6-ea99-4158-830c-09ad0b484b75\\"}]", "live": true, "path": "000100020007", "slug": "virtuel", "depth": 3, "owner": 1, "title": "Virtuel", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/accueil-2/virtuel/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "Virtuel", "content_type": 29, "header_title": "Accompagnement virtuel", "introduction": "", "live_revision": 254, "show_in_menus": false, "header_subtitle": "Accompagnement virtuel périnatal", "latest_revision": 254, "translation_key": "50169007-fa6c-432a-b4db-941f1fe53e85", "show_page_header": true, "header_background": 8, "last_published_at": "2025-10-02T19:41:43.453Z", "first_published_at": "2025-10-02T19:41:43.453Z", "search_description": "", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": false, "latest_revision_created_at": "2025-10-02T19:41:43.428Z"}	\N	18	1	29	1	Virtuel
202	2025-10-01 11:05:00.744934-04	{"pk": 14, "body": "[{\\"type\\": \\"paragraphs\\", \\"value\\": {\\"paragraphs\\": [{\\"type\\": \\"item\\", \\"value\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"onpe8\\\\\\">Faire partie du conseil d\\\\u2019administration est une occasion unique de prendre part aux d\\\\u00e9cisions de l'organisme, de comprendre les d\\\\u00e9tails du fonctionnement \\\\u00e0 l'interne et de soutenir l'\\\\u00e9quipe sur le terrain alors qu'elle d\\\\u00e9ploie des services essentiels aux familles de notre communaut\\\\u00e9.</p>\\", \\"id\\": \\"1d8e0082-690a-4498-909f-966169323332\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"item\\", \\"value\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"s93iq\\\\\\"></p><p data-block-key=\\\\\\"9oi8a\\\\\\">Si vous avez le go\\\\u00fbt de participer activement au rayonnement d\\\\u2019un organisme communautaire que vous tenez \\\\u00e0 c\\\\u0153ur, ou si vous voulez plus de renseignements, n\\\\u2019h\\\\u00e9sitez pas \\\\u00e0 <b>nous contacter</b> (lien vers \\\\u00ab\\\\u00a0Contact g\\\\u00e9n\\\\u00e9ral\\\\u00a0\\\\u00bb)! Il nous fera plaisir de discuter de tout \\\\u00e7a avec vous!</p>\\", \\"id\\": \\"6453a4b9-b8ff-4a88-834d-1d522503f717\\"}]}, \\"id\\": \\"8ae44765-fa2f-4da9-8fc3-7cb662a89b6d\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"benefits\\", \\"value\\": {\\"image\\": 7, \\"title\\": \\"Qu\\\\u2019est-ce que le conseil d\\\\u2019administration?\\", \\"points\\": [{\\"type\\": \\"item\\", \\"value\\": {\\"text\\": \\"Le conseil d\\\\u2019administration est un regroupement de 7 personnes qui veille au bon fonctionnement de l'organisme, \\\\u00e0 sa sant\\\\u00e9 financi\\\\u00e8re, \\\\u00e0 sa croissance et \\\\u00e0 son rayonnement en soutenant la superbe \\\\u00e9quipe du bureau ainsi que les accompagnant.e.s, animateur.trice.s et formateur.trice.s offrant des services aux familles.\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"7abb298e-3cbf-464e-87b9-9ec6656d7c19\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"item\\", \\"value\\": {\\"text\\": \\"Le conseil d\\\\u2019administration se rencontre environ 10 fois par ann\\\\u00e9e. Selon leurs disponibilit\\\\u00e9s et leur expertise, les membres peuvent aussi participer \\\\u00e0 des comit\\\\u00e9s afin de faire avancer certains projets qu\\\\u2019ils.elles tiennent \\\\u00e0 c\\\\u0153ur et qui font partie du plan d\\\\u2019action \\\\u00e9tabli lors de l\\\\u2019assembl\\\\u00e9e g\\\\u00e9n\\\\u00e9rale annuelle.\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"03414cae-2bb4-4f13-8d53-27b505d5ba0d\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"item\\", \\"value\\": {\\"text\\": \\"Les membres sont \\\\u00e9lu.e.s lors de l\\\\u2019assembl\\\\u00e9e g\\\\u00e9n\\\\u00e9rale annuelle pour un mandat de 2 ans (l\\\\u2019assembl\\\\u00e9e se tient habituellement en d\\\\u00e9but juin).\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"70d614f4-2ed3-4fa7-a509-f0fba14ed4d9\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"item\\", \\"value\\": {\\"text\\": \\"Le conseil d\\\\u2019administration est compos\\\\u00e9 de 3 membres militant.e.s (personnes qui travaillent \\\\u00e0 titre autonome pour l\\\\u2019organisme) et 4 membres individuel.le.s (personnes de la communaut\\\\u00e9 ayant b\\\\u00e9n\\\\u00e9fici\\\\u00e9 des services de l\\\\u2019organisme).\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"8220f7d6-9eb6-4560-a445-679231c64691\\"}]}, \\"id\\": \\"0010d1e9-509f-4123-be1d-a7c02d21a938\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"testimonials\\", \\"value\\": {\\"section\\": 1}, \\"id\\": \\"e5d343a5-1b12-4a3a-a0e0-2cb952caa27c\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"team\\", \\"value\\": {\\"members\\": [{\\"type\\": \\"item\\", \\"value\\": {\\"image\\": 1, \\"role\\": \\"president\\", \\"name\\": \\"Polo\\", \\"facebook\\": \\"https://facebook.com/alternativetest\\", \\"twitter\\": \\"https://twitter.com/alternativetest\\", \\"linkedin\\": \\"https://linkedIn.com/alternativetest\\", \\"instagram\\": \\"https://instagram.com/alternativetest\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"d5cff833-efc3-4ad7-b29e-b8d7d7f72802\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"item\\", \\"value\\": {\\"image\\": 7, \\"role\\": \\"Secretaire\\", \\"name\\": \\"Lise Martine\\", \\"facebook\\": \\"https://facebook.com/alternativetest\\", \\"twitter\\": \\"https://twitter.com/alternativetest\\", \\"linkedin\\": \\"https://linkedIn.com/alternativetest\\", \\"instagram\\": \\"https://instagram.com/alternativetest\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"db54fdb5-4b36-4dc4-b831-3a1b73933e24\\"}]}, \\"id\\": \\"659a19e3-808b-4542-bd3b-44bd07d9b8a7\\"}]", "live": true, "path": "000100020003", "slug": "conseil-administration", "depth": 3, "owner": 1, "title": "Conseil d'administration", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/accueil-2/conseil-administration/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "Conseil d'administration", "content_type": 29, "header_title": "Conseil d'administration", "introduction": "", "live_revision": 200, "show_in_menus": false, "header_subtitle": "Conseil d'administration", "latest_revision": 201, "translation_key": "21b3fa3b-b848-4714-906e-d10623e6d512", "show_page_header": true, "header_background": 5, "last_published_at": "2025-10-01T14:55:13.932Z", "first_published_at": "2025-09-27T01:16:03.648Z", "search_description": "", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": true, "latest_revision_created_at": "2025-10-01T15:04:48.166Z"}	\N	14	1	29	1	Conseil d'administration
209	2025-10-01 12:15:24.305658-04	{"pk": 16, "body": "[]", "live": false, "path": "000100020005", "slug": "naissance", "depth": 3, "owner": 1, "title": "Naissance", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/accueil-2/naissance/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "Naissance", "content_type": 29, "header_title": "Naissance", "introduction": "", "live_revision": null, "show_in_menus": false, "header_subtitle": "Accompagnement à la naissance", "latest_revision": null, "translation_key": "c383c2d7-97c5-44d0-8d5c-d3d5b31b75f2", "show_page_header": true, "header_background": 8, "last_published_at": null, "first_published_at": null, "search_description": "", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": false, "latest_revision_created_at": null}	\N	16	1	29	1	Naissance
144	2025-09-26 11:40:32.028235-04	{"pk": 11, "body": "[{\\"type\\": \\"why_choose\\", \\"value\\": {\\"title\\": \\"La mission\\", \\"subtitle\\": \\"Depuis 1982\\", \\"text\\": \\"Depuis 1982, Alternative Naissance offre du soutien aux femmes et aux personnes\\\\r\\\\nenceintes, aux couples et aux familles durant la grossesse, l\\\\u2019accouchement et la p\\\\u00e9riode\\\\r\\\\npostnatale.\\\\r\\\\nLa mission de l\\\\u2019organisme vise l\\\\u2019humanisation de la grossesse, de la naissance et de la p\\\\u00e9riode postnatale.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nLa qualit\\\\u00e9 du soutien re\\\\u00e7u lors de ces p\\\\u00e9riodes a une incidence profonde et \\\\u00e0 long terme sur :\\\\r\\\\nL\\\\u2019autonomie et le pouvoir d\\\\u2019agir;\\\\r\\\\nLe sentiment de comp\\\\u00e9tence et l\\\\u2019estime de soi;\\\\r\\\\nLe sentiment de comp\\\\u00e9tence et l\\\\u2019estime de soi;\\\\r\\\\nL\\\\u2019int\\\\u00e9gration du deuil (s\\\\u2019il y a lieu);\\\\r\\\\nL\\\\u2019int\\\\u00e9gration du deuil (s\\\\u2019il y a lieu);\\", \\"image\\": 7, \\"layout\\": \\"text_left\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"073aef45-9cca-4d75-9da6-b16364fa425e\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"why_choose\\", \\"value\\": {\\"title\\": \\"Les valeurs\\", \\"subtitle\\": \\"\\", \\"text\\": \\"Compos\\\\u00e9e d\\\\u2019une belle diversit\\\\u00e9 culturelle et identitaire qu\\\\u2019elle \\\\u0153uvre \\\\u00e0 honorer et \\\\u00e0 respecter, l\\\\u2019\\\\u00e9quipe d\\\\u2019Alternative Naissance souhaite offrir un service individuel et personnalis\\\\u00e9, inclusif, empathique, accueillant, respectueux et solidaire. Elle priorise en tout temps l\\\\u2019\\\\u00e9coute, le respect du pouvoir d\\\\u2019agir, l\\\\u2019autonomie et la reconnaissance de l\\\\u2019expertise de chacun concernant son v\\\\u00e9cu ou ses besoins.\\", \\"image\\": 8, \\"layout\\": \\"text_right\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"e37acb24-600b-4276-a9a8-bd3d33e8177b\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"testimonials\\", \\"value\\": {\\"section\\": 1}, \\"id\\": \\"3ee0ce71-306c-4629-8b44-5b82ea3265f7\\"}]", "live": true, "path": "000100020001", "slug": "mission", "depth": 3, "owner": 1, "title": "Mission", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/accueil-2/mission/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "Mission", "content_type": 29, "header_title": "Mission", "introduction": "", "live_revision": 139, "show_in_menus": false, "header_subtitle": "Mission, valeurs et engagement", "latest_revision": 143, "translation_key": "9d75e167-cb70-44ef-a65a-0e0e276617a1", "show_page_header": true, "header_background": 8, "last_published_at": "2025-09-25T20:31:39.519Z", "first_published_at": "2025-09-25T20:10:12.010Z", "search_description": "", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": true, "latest_revision_created_at": "2025-09-26T15:34:20.496Z"}	\N	11	1	29	1	Mission
152	2025-09-26 18:06:38.781819-04	{"pk": 11, "body": "[{\\"type\\": \\"why_choose\\", \\"value\\": {\\"title\\": \\"La mission\\", \\"subtitle\\": \\"Depuis 1982\\", \\"text\\": \\"Depuis 1982, Alternative Naissance offre du soutien aux femmes et aux personnes\\\\r\\\\nenceintes, aux couples et aux familles durant la grossesse, l\\\\u2019accouchement et la p\\\\u00e9riode\\\\r\\\\npostnatale.\\\\r\\\\nLa mission de l\\\\u2019organisme vise l\\\\u2019humanisation de la grossesse, de la naissance et de la p\\\\u00e9riode postnatale.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nLa qualit\\\\u00e9 du soutien re\\\\u00e7u lors de ces p\\\\u00e9riodes a une incidence profonde et \\\\u00e0 long terme sur :\\\\r\\\\nL\\\\u2019autonomie et le pouvoir d\\\\u2019agir;\\\\r\\\\nLe sentiment de comp\\\\u00e9tence et l\\\\u2019estime de soi;\\\\r\\\\nLe sentiment de comp\\\\u00e9tence et l\\\\u2019estime de soi;\\\\r\\\\nL\\\\u2019int\\\\u00e9gration du deuil (s\\\\u2019il y a lieu);\\\\r\\\\nL\\\\u2019int\\\\u00e9gration du deuil (s\\\\u2019il y a lieu);\\", \\"image\\": 7, \\"layout\\": \\"text_left\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"073aef45-9cca-4d75-9da6-b16364fa425e\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"why_choose\\", \\"value\\": {\\"title\\": \\"Les valeurs\\", \\"subtitle\\": \\"\\", \\"text\\": \\"Compos\\\\u00e9e d\\\\u2019une belle diversit\\\\u00e9 culturelle et identitaire qu\\\\u2019elle \\\\u0153uvre \\\\u00e0 honorer et \\\\u00e0 respecter, l\\\\u2019\\\\u00e9quipe d\\\\u2019Alternative Naissance souhaite offrir un service individuel et personnalis\\\\u00e9, inclusif, empathique, accueillant, respectueux et solidaire. Elle priorise en tout temps l\\\\u2019\\\\u00e9coute, le respect du pouvoir d\\\\u2019agir, l\\\\u2019autonomie et la reconnaissance de l\\\\u2019expertise de chacun concernant son v\\\\u00e9cu ou ses besoins.\\", \\"image\\": 8, \\"layout\\": \\"text_right\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"e37acb24-600b-4276-a9a8-bd3d33e8177b\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"why_choose\\", \\"value\\": {\\"title\\": \\"Engagement\\", \\"subtitle\\": \\"\\", \\"text\\": \\"Notre mission s\\\\u2019incarne principalement \\\\u00e0 travers les services individualis\\\\u00e9s offerts par nos accompagnant.e.s et intervenant.e.s, que ce soit dans le cadre des rencontres pr\\\\u00e9natales ou postnatales, de la pr\\\\u00e9sence \\\\u00e0 l\\\\u2019accouchement, des rencontres en relevailles ou des divers ateliers offerts par l\\\\u2019organisme.\\\\r\\\\nL\\\\u2019organisme veille en tout temps \\\\u00e0 sensibiliser notre \\\\u00e9quipe ainsi que les intervenant.e.s des milieux communautaire et institutionnel aux enjeux li\\\\u00e9s \\\\u00e0 la p\\\\u00e9rinatalit\\\\u00e9, ainsi qu\\\\u2019aux enjeux particuliers li\\\\u00e9s aux identit\\\\u00e9s diverses et intersectionnelles des familles que nous accompagnons (diversit\\\\u00e9 de genre, diversit\\\\u00e9 culturelle, diversit\\\\u00e9 familiale, etc.).\\", \\"image\\": 7, \\"layout\\": \\"text_left\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"eb4e5b38-491e-41f4-ba1c-1c4bd9bc4348\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"testimonials\\", \\"value\\": {\\"section\\": 1}, \\"id\\": \\"3ee0ce71-306c-4629-8b44-5b82ea3265f7\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"benefits\\", \\"value\\": {\\"text\\": \\"test\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"68209666-3af0-48f3-b2ec-55ae356e3776\\"}]", "live": true, "path": "000100020001", "slug": "mission", "depth": 3, "owner": 1, "title": "Mission", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/accueil-2/mission/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "Mission", "content_type": 29, "header_title": "Mission", "introduction": "", "live_revision": 150, "show_in_menus": false, "header_subtitle": "Mission, valeurs et engagement", "latest_revision": 151, "translation_key": "9d75e167-cb70-44ef-a65a-0e0e276617a1", "show_page_header": true, "header_background": 8, "last_published_at": "2025-09-26T21:52:59.583Z", "first_published_at": "2025-09-25T20:10:12.010Z", "search_description": "", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": true, "latest_revision_created_at": "2025-09-26T22:05:59.466Z"}	\N	11	1	29	1	Mission
168	2025-09-26 18:58:17.522832-04	{"pk": 11, "body": "[{\\"type\\": \\"why_choose\\", \\"value\\": {\\"title\\": \\"La mission\\", \\"subtitle\\": \\"Depuis 1982\\", \\"text\\": \\"Depuis 1982, Alternative Naissance offre du soutien aux femmes et aux personnes\\\\r\\\\nenceintes, aux couples et aux familles durant la grossesse, l\\\\u2019accouchement et la p\\\\u00e9riode\\\\r\\\\npostnatale.\\\\r\\\\nLa mission de l\\\\u2019organisme vise l\\\\u2019humanisation de la grossesse, de la naissance et de la p\\\\u00e9riode postnatale.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\nLa qualit\\\\u00e9 du soutien re\\\\u00e7u lors de ces p\\\\u00e9riodes a une incidence profonde et \\\\u00e0 long terme sur :\\\\r\\\\nL\\\\u2019autonomie et le pouvoir d\\\\u2019agir;\\\\r\\\\nLe sentiment de comp\\\\u00e9tence et l\\\\u2019estime de soi;\\\\r\\\\nLe sentiment de comp\\\\u00e9tence et l\\\\u2019estime de soi;\\\\r\\\\nL\\\\u2019int\\\\u00e9gration du deuil (s\\\\u2019il y a lieu);\\\\r\\\\nL\\\\u2019int\\\\u00e9gration du deuil (s\\\\u2019il y a lieu);\\", \\"image\\": 7, \\"layout\\": \\"text_left\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"073aef45-9cca-4d75-9da6-b16364fa425e\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"why_choose\\", \\"value\\": {\\"title\\": \\"Les valeurs\\", \\"subtitle\\": \\"\\", \\"text\\": \\"Compos\\\\u00e9e d\\\\u2019une belle diversit\\\\u00e9 culturelle et identitaire qu\\\\u2019elle \\\\u0153uvre \\\\u00e0 honorer et \\\\u00e0 respecter, l\\\\u2019\\\\u00e9quipe d\\\\u2019Alternative Naissance souhaite offrir un service individuel et personnalis\\\\u00e9, inclusif, empathique, accueillant, respectueux et solidaire. Elle priorise en tout temps l\\\\u2019\\\\u00e9coute, le respect du pouvoir d\\\\u2019agir, l\\\\u2019autonomie et la reconnaissance de l\\\\u2019expertise de chacun concernant son v\\\\u00e9cu ou ses besoins.\\", \\"image\\": 8, \\"layout\\": \\"text_right\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"e37acb24-600b-4276-a9a8-bd3d33e8177b\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"why_choose\\", \\"value\\": {\\"title\\": \\"Engagement\\", \\"subtitle\\": \\"\\", \\"text\\": \\"Notre mission s\\\\u2019incarne principalement \\\\u00e0 travers les services individualis\\\\u00e9s offerts par nos accompagnant.e.s et intervenant.e.s, que ce soit dans le cadre des rencontres pr\\\\u00e9natales ou postnatales, de la pr\\\\u00e9sence \\\\u00e0 l\\\\u2019accouchement, des rencontres en relevailles ou des divers ateliers offerts par l\\\\u2019organisme.\\\\r\\\\nL\\\\u2019organisme veille en tout temps \\\\u00e0 sensibiliser notre \\\\u00e9quipe ainsi que les intervenant.e.s des milieux communautaire et institutionnel aux enjeux li\\\\u00e9s \\\\u00e0 la p\\\\u00e9rinatalit\\\\u00e9, ainsi qu\\\\u2019aux enjeux particuliers li\\\\u00e9s aux identit\\\\u00e9s diverses et intersectionnelles des familles que nous accompagnons (diversit\\\\u00e9 de genre, diversit\\\\u00e9 culturelle, diversit\\\\u00e9 familiale, etc.).\\", \\"image\\": 7, \\"layout\\": \\"text_left\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"eb4e5b38-491e-41f4-ba1c-1c4bd9bc4348\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"testimonials\\", \\"value\\": {\\"section\\": 1}, \\"id\\": \\"3ee0ce71-306c-4629-8b44-5b82ea3265f7\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"benefits\\", \\"value\\": {\\"image\\": 7, \\"title\\": \\"La qualit\\\\u00e9 du soutien re\\\\u00e7u lors de ces p\\\\u00e9riodes a une incidence profonde et \\\\u00e0 long terme sur :\\", \\"points\\": [{\\"type\\": \\"item\\", \\"value\\": {\\"text\\": \\"L\\\\u2019autonomie et le pouvoir d\\\\u2019agir;\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"e7dda04a-b497-4031-8fab-62d3dd0b8db6\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"item\\", \\"value\\": {\\"text\\": \\"Le sentiment de comp\\\\u00e9tence et l\\\\u2019estime de soi;\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"5cfe53dd-5f3e-4bcb-809d-da2ff09315c0\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"item\\", \\"value\\": {\\"text\\": \\"Le sentiment de comp\\\\u00e9tence et l\\\\u2019estime de soi;\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"1df5f4b6-cdb8-45cf-bd74-8d3caf1f8b84\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"item\\", \\"value\\": {\\"text\\": \\"L\\\\u2019int\\\\u00e9gration du deuil (s\\\\u2019il y a lieu);\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"92f6c631-79ff-47f2-9749-aa611a0efc62\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"item\\", \\"value\\": {\\"text\\": \\"L\\\\u2019int\\\\u00e9gration du deuil (s\\\\u2019il y a lieu);\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"a9fe4450-a088-440f-ad68-221dbf091fba\\"}]}, \\"id\\": \\"31f743d7-eafa-4356-8d14-18455685048a\\"}]", "live": true, "path": "000100020001", "slug": "mission", "depth": 3, "owner": 1, "title": "Mission", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/accueil-2/mission/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "Mission", "content_type": 29, "header_title": "Mission", "introduction": "", "live_revision": 166, "show_in_menus": false, "header_subtitle": "Mission, valeurs et engagement", "latest_revision": 167, "translation_key": "9d75e167-cb70-44ef-a65a-0e0e276617a1", "show_page_header": true, "header_background": 8, "last_published_at": "2025-09-26T22:54:28.818Z", "first_published_at": "2025-09-25T20:10:12.010Z", "search_description": "", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": true, "latest_revision_created_at": "2025-09-26T22:58:13.794Z"}	\N	11	1	29	1	Mission
