262	2025-10-02 16:03:57.359394-04	{"pk": 21, "body": "[{\\"type\\": \\"cta\\", \\"value\\": {\\"title\\": \\"Cliquez ici pour faire une demande de service.\\", \\"phone_number\\": \\"+1514-777-6666\\", \\"phone_text\\": \\"Appelez nos accompagnatrices\\", \\"button_text\\": \\"Demande de service\\", \\"button_link\\": \\"\\", \\"image\\": 7}, \\"id\\": \\"8a806d87-534b-4091-8802-4158cf19ea5b\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"paragraphs\\", \\"value\\": {\\"paragraphs\\": [{\\"type\\": \\"item\\", \\"value\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"u6it1\\\\\\">Alternative Naissance offre un service d\\\\u2019intervention p\\\\u00e9rinatale individuel et gratuit visant \\\\u00e0 soutenir les familles qui traversent la p\\\\u00e9riode p\\\\u00e9rinatale, et ce, d\\\\u00e8s la grossesse et jusqu\\\\u2019\\\\u00e0 6 mois apr\\\\u00e8s la naissance. L\\\\u2019intervenant.e p\\\\u00e9rinatal.e offre des services dans un climat d\\\\u2019\\\\u00e9coute, de respect et d\\\\u2019ouverture d\\\\u2019esprit et met en valeur les comp\\\\u00e9tences parentales tout en encourageant l\\\\u2019autonomisation des parents.</p>\\", \\"id\\": \\"7868a7ad-eacd-43a1-9f04-3b4e9296485d\\"}]}, \\"id\\": \\"77fdf7d5-606a-4bec-a6f5-6d04d733710c\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"liste\\", \\"value\\": {\\"title\\": \\"Ce service s\\\\u2019adresse aux familles ayant des besoins ponctuels tels que :\\", \\"points\\": [{\\"type\\": \\"item\\", \\"value\\": {\\"text\\": \\"La recherche de biens mat\\\\u00e9riels;\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"9c70791d-bb98-4052-b5d5-4caae985f81d\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"item\\", \\"value\\": {\\"text\\": \\"La recherche de ressources communautaires;\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"36156f08-e900-4ef0-83f1-dba8352756d7\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"item\\", \\"value\\": {\\"text\\": \\"La navigation du syst\\\\u00e8me social ou de sant\\\\u00e9;\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"e94e2e63-908e-4396-ad24-be3cd2819545\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"item\\", \\"value\\": {\\"text\\": \\"Les t\\\\u00e2ches administratives li\\\\u00e9es \\\\u00e0 l\\\\u2019accouchement ou \\\\u00e0 la naissance d\\\\u2019un enfant;\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"d7678bfa-272f-4e32-941e-7885fde2fcd0\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"item\\", \\"value\\": {\\"text\\": \\"Des d\\\\u00e9fis d\\\\u2019organisation familiale;\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"b06413d3-534f-40f8-85c6-75195157725f\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"item\\", \\"value\\": {\\"text\\": \\"Des difficult\\\\u00e9s d\\\\u2019allaitement;\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"6d3ce7a5-91b5-4f2b-85d1-5170fdaddc00\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"item\\", \\"value\\": {\\"text\\": \\"Etc.\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"572c1f09-4882-4f4a-abef-f0cc19527b8f\\"}]}, \\"id\\": \\"c446a8ee-cb95-4218-bb66-6ad45f8217ec\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"paragraphs\\", \\"value\\": {\\"paragraphs\\": [{\\"type\\": \\"item\\", \\"value\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"u6it1\\\\\\">La disponibilit\\\\u00e9 du service d\\\\u00e9pend du quartier o\\\\u00f9 habite la famille, des situations auxquelles elle fait face et des autres demandes faites \\\\u00e0 l\\\\u2019organisme.</p>\\", \\"id\\": \\"7868a7ad-eacd-43a1-9f04-3b4e9296485d\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"item\\", \\"value\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"4k058\\\\\\">Concr\\\\u00e8tement, le service d\\\\u2019intervention p\\\\u00e9rinatale comprend habituellement 1 \\\\u00e0 3 rencontres \\\\u00e0 domicile lors desquelles tous les enjeux v\\\\u00e9cus entourant la p\\\\u00e9rinatalit\\\\u00e9 pourront \\\\u00eatre discut\\\\u00e9s. Si la famille exprime un besoin ayant au-del\\\\u00e0 de ce suivi ponctuel, l\\\\u2019intervenant.e sera en mesure de l\\\\u2019accompagner vers les ressources appropri\\\\u00e9es.</p>\\", \\"id\\": \\"44eb229b-82d2-4c1e-8353-13f9d4086f94\\"}]}, \\"id\\": \\"54b8037f-6d1c-4886-bda3-97756dca922f\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"cta\\", \\"value\\": {\\"title\\": \\"Cliquez ici pour faire une demande de service.\\", \\"phone_number\\": \\"+1514-777-6666\\", \\"phone_text\\": \\"Appelez nos accompagnatrices\\", \\"button_text\\": \\"Demande de service\\", \\"button_link\\": \\"\\", \\"image\\": 7}, \\"id\\": \\"722dcb5d-0955-4f6a-ad9d-ebe0e447edc7\\"}]", "live": false, "path": "00010002000A", "slug": "intervention-périnatale", "depth": 3, "owner": 1, "title": "Intervention périnatale", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/accueil-2/intervention-périnatale/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "Intervention périnatale", "content_type": 29, "header_title": "Intervention périnatale", "introduction": "", "live_revision": null, "show_in_menus": false, "header_subtitle": "Intervention périnatale", "latest_revision": 261, "translation_key": "e16e7fa7-1bec-4efd-ac83-892f15908cc9", "show_page_header": true, "header_background": 8, "last_published_at": null, "first_published_at": null, "search_description": "", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": true, "latest_revision_created_at": "2025-10-02T20:03:54.735Z"}	\N	21	1	29	1	Intervention périnatale
